The tortures you had to endure on the Fearscape have increased your resilience.

All detrimental status effects last [5%, 10%, 13%, 17%, 20% (TL1-5)] less on you and all direct critical hits (physical, mental, spells) against you have a [10%, 16%, 22%, 27%, 32% (TL1-5)] lower critical multiplier (but always do at least normal damage).
